          "contentHtml": "\n<div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#fffdf7] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[6px_6px_0px_#151b20] text-center my-3\">\n  <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#c9f3f4] border-2 border-[#151b20] text-[#0e7490] font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-3\">\n    <span>Track 3 • Ethics, Privacy &amp; Governance • Lesson 3.2</span>\n  </div>\n  <h1 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-[#151b20] tracking-tight mb-2\">\n    Core Ethical Principles: Non-Maleficence, Fairness, Transparency &amp; Autonomy\n  </h1>\n  <p class=\"text-sm sm:text-base text-[#475569] font-medium max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed\">\n    Transforming Belmont, OECD, and IEEE ethical pillars into deterministic engineering tests, quantitative disparity metrics, and automated CI/CD deployment gates.\n  </p>\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-3 mt-5 max-w-4xl mx-auto text-left font-mono text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#fff0b9] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#151b20]\">\n      <strong class=\"text-[#b45309] block mb-1 font-black\">1. Five Pillars</strong>\n      <span class=\"text-[11px] text-[#151b20] leading-snug\">Non-Maleficence, Fairness, Transparency, Accountability &amp; Autonomy.</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#c9f3f4] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#151b20]\">\n      <strong class=\"text-[#0e7490] block mb-1 font-black\">2. Justice Math</strong>\n      <span class=\"text-[11px] text-[#151b20] leading-snug\">Rawlsian Maximin $W_{\\text{Rawls}}$, Benefit-to-Risk Ratio $\\text{BRR}$, and SHAP $\\phi_j$.</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#ffd8ce] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#151b20]\">\n      <strong class=\"text-[#b91c1c] block mb-1 font-black\">3. Fairness Trilemma</strong>\n      <span class=\"text-[11px] text-[#151b20] leading-snug\">DIR, Equalized Odds, Predictive Parity &amp; Chouldechova's Impossibility Theorem.</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#e7f4c8] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#151b20]\">\n      <strong class=\"text-[#15803d] block mb-1 font-black\">4. Case Audits</strong>\n      <span class=\"text-[11px] text-[#151b20] leading-snug\">Obermeyer health proxy, Amazon recruiting, COMPAS, and Pydantic V2 gates.</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n"
