          "contentHtml": "<div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-[#fffdf7] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[4px_4px_0px_#151b20] my-2 overflow-x-auto text-center\">\n  <div class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-[#0e7490] font-black uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 text-left flex items-center justify-between border-b-2 border-[#151b20]/15 pb-1\">\n    <span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n      <span>📊 Architecture &amp; Workflow Diagram</span>\n      <span class=\"text-[#151b20]/40\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"text-[#334155]\">System Flowchart</span>\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"text-[#0e7490] text-[9px] font-mono bg-[#c9f3f4] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-[#151b20]\">Mermaid SVG</span>\n  </div>\n  <pre class=\"mermaid py-1 flex justify-center text-xs overflow-x-auto leading-normal\">flowchart TD\n    D1[\"Dilemma 1: Public Health Surveillance vs Autonomy<br/>(COVID-19 digital contact tracing vs unconsented location tracking)\"]\n    D2[\"Dilemma 2: Institutional Accuracy vs Group Fairness<br/>(COMPAS recidivism risk: overall accuracy vs racial parity)\"]\n    D3[\"Dilemma 3: Engagement Optimization vs Mental Health<br/>(Social media recommendation feeds: clicks vs addictive polarization)\"]\n\n    classDef blue fill:#c9f3f4,stroke:#151b20,stroke-width:2px,color:#151b20;\n    classDef amber fill:#fff0b9,stroke:#151b20,stroke-width:2px,color:#151b20;\n    classDef purple fill:#e2dfff,stroke:#151b20,stroke-width:2px,color:#151b20;\n\n    class D1 blue;\n    class D2 amber;\n    class D3 purple;</pre>\n</div><div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#fffdf7] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#151b20] flex items-start gap-2.5 my-2\">\n  <span class=\"text-[#0e7490] font-black text-sm mt-0.5\">◆</span>\n  <div>\n    <strong class=\"text-[#0e7490] text-xs md:text-sm font-black block\">Public Health vs. Civil Autonomy</strong>\n    <span class=\"text-[#334155] text-xs block mt-0.5 leading-relaxed font-medium\">High-frequency mobile GPS trajectories enable automated infectious disease contact tracing, yet exposing real-time spatial vectors creates permanent surveillance architecture (Abowd, 2018).</span>\n  </div>\n</div><div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#fffdf7] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#151b20] flex items-start gap-2.5 my-2\">\n  <span class=\"text-[#0e7490] font-black text-sm mt-0.5\">▸</span>\n  <div>\n    <strong class=\"text-[#0e7490] text-xs md:text-sm font-black block\">Predictive Calibration vs. Demographic Parity</strong>\n    <span class=\"text-[#334155] text-xs block mt-0.5 leading-relaxed font-medium\">The famous ProPublica analysis of the COMPAS recidivism instrument (Angwin, 2016) demonstrated that maintaining equal calibration across Black and white defendants resulted in twice the false positive rate for Black defendants ($44.9\\%$ vs $23.5\\%$).</span>\n  </div>\n</div><div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#fffdf7] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#151b20] flex items-start gap-2.5 my-2\">\n  <span class=\"text-[#0e7490] font-black text-sm mt-0.5\">⚡</span>\n  <div>\n    <strong class=\"text-[#0e7490] text-xs md:text-sm font-black block\">Engagement vs. Mental Health Externalities</strong>\n    <span class=\"text-[#334155] text-xs block mt-0.5 leading-relaxed font-medium\">Training recommendation models strictly on click-through and dwell time maximizes advertising revenue while imposing severe psychological externalities through sensationalist content loops.</span>\n  </div>\n</div>"
