        "title": "Key Engineering Takeaways",
        "type": "bullets",
        "solo": {
          "speaker": "Dr. Nova (Senior Architect)",
          "title": "Key Engineering Takeaways",
          "turns": [
            {
              "speaker": "Dr. Nova",
              "text": "Key Engineering Takeaways. Data-Centric AI requires treating dataset curation with the exact same rigor, versioning, and defensive auditing as neural model code. Fixing defects at the boundary guarantees downstream reliability."
            }
          ],
          "contentHtml": "<div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#fffdf7] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#151b20] flex items-start gap-2.5 my-2\">\n  <span class=\"text-[#0e7490] font-black text-sm mt-0.5\">◆</span>\n  <div>\n    <strong class=\"text-[#0e7490] text-xs md:text-sm font-black block\">The Pareto Frontier</strong>\n    <span class=\"text-[#334155] text-xs block mt-0.5 leading-relaxed font-medium\">Privacy and analytical utility cannot be maximized simultaneously; data architects must identify and document the Pareto-optimal operating point.</span>\n  </div>\n</div><div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#fffdf7] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#151b20] flex items-start gap-2.5 my-2\">\n  <span class=\"text-[#0e7490] font-black text-sm mt-0.5\">▸</span>\n  <div>\n    <strong class=\"text-[#0e7490] text-xs md:text-sm font-black block\">Kleinberg Impossibility</strong>\n    <span class=\"text-[#334155] text-xs block mt-0.5 leading-relaxed font-medium\">If demographic base rates differ, an algorithm cannot simultaneously satisfy predictive calibration and equal false positive rates.</span>\n  </div>\n</div><div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#fffdf7] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#151b20] flex items-start gap-2.5 my-2\">\n  <span class=\"text-[#0e7490] font-black text-sm mt-0.5\">⚡</span>\n  <div>\n    <strong class=\"text-[#0e7490] text-xs md:text-sm font-black block\">Internalizing Externalities</strong>\n    <span class=\"text-[#334155] text-xs block mt-0.5 leading-relaxed font-medium\">Engineering teams are morally and legally accountable for societal externalities created by optimization objectives.</span>\n  </div>\n</div><div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#fffdf7] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#151b20] flex items-start gap-2.5 my-2\">\n  <span class=\"text-[#0e7490] font-black text-sm mt-0.5\">💡</span>\n  <div>\n    <strong class=\"text-[#0e7490] text-xs md:text-sm font-black block\">Risk-Averse Certainty</strong>\n    <span class=\"text-[#334155] text-xs block mt-0.5 leading-relaxed font-medium\">Incorporate downside variance penalties when releasing high-consequence datasets.</span>\n  </div>\n</div>"
        },
