          "contentHtml": "<div class=\"p-6 md:p-8 rounded-2xl bg-[#fffdf7] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[5px_5px_0px_#22bfd7] text-center space-y-4\">\n  <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#c9f3f4] text-[#0e7490] font-mono text-xs border-2 border-[#151b20] font-black uppercase tracking-wider shadow-[2px_2px_0px_#151b20]\">\n    <span>◆ Track 3: Foundations</span>\n    <span>•</span>\n    <span>Lesson 3.4</span>\n  </div>\n  <h2 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-black text-[#151b20] tracking-tight\">\n    Data Privacy Principles: Informed Consent, Quasi-Identifiers &amp; Privacy by Design\n  </h2>\n  <p class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-[#334155] max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed font-medium\">\n    Deep dive into data privacy principles: informed consent, quasi-identifiers &amp; privacy by design with formal mathematical formulations, production engineering, and failure-mode analysis.\n  </p>\n  <div class=\"pt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs\">\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-[#fff0b9] border border-[#151b20] font-bold text-[#151b20]\">📐 Formal Foundations</span>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-[#ffd8ce] border border-[#151b20] font-bold text-[#151b20]\">⚠️ Failure Modes</span>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-[#c9f3f4] border border-[#151b20] font-bold text-[#151b20]\">🛡️ Production Contracts</span>\n  </div>\n</div>"
