          "contentHtml": "<div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-[#fffdf7] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[4px_4px_0px_#151b20] my-2 overflow-x-auto text-center\">\n  <div class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-[#0e7490] font-black uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 text-left flex items-center justify-between border-b-2 border-[#151b20]/15 pb-1\">\n    <span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n      <span>📊 Architecture &amp; Workflow Diagram</span>\n      <span class=\"text-[#151b20]/40\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"text-[#334155]\">System Flowchart</span>\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"text-[#0e7490] text-[9px] font-mono bg-[#c9f3f4] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-[#151b20]\">Mermaid SVG</span>\n  </div>\n  <pre class=\"mermaid py-1 flex justify-center text-xs overflow-x-auto leading-normal\">flowchart TD\n    Data[\"Raw Dataset Schema D\"] --> Direct[\"1. Direct Identifiers (D_id)\"]\n    Data --> Quasi[\"2. Quasi-Identifiers (Q_id)\"]\n    Data --> Sensitive[\"3. Sensitive Attributes (S_attr)\"]\n    Data --> NonSens[\"4. Insensitive Attributes (Z)\"]\n\n    Direct --> Ex1[\"SSN, Full Name, Email, Biometric Scan\"]\n    Quasi --> Ex2[\"5-Digit ZIP, Birthdate, Gender, Job Title\"]\n    Sensitive --> Ex3[\"Medical Diagnosis, Salary, Criminal Record\"]\n    NonSens --> Ex4[\"Favorite Color, UI Theme, Browser Brand\"]\n\n    classDef blue fill:#c9f3f4,stroke:#151b20,stroke-width:2px,color:#151b20;\n    classDef amber fill:#fff0b9,stroke:#151b20,stroke-width:2px,color:#151b20;\n    classDef purple fill:#e2dfff,stroke:#151b20,stroke-width:2px,color:#151b20;\n    classDef green fill:#e7f4c8,stroke:#151b20,stroke-width:2px,color:#151b20;\n    classDef red fill:#ffd8ce,stroke:#151b20,stroke-width:2px,color:#151b20;\n\n    class Data blue;\n    class Direct,Ex1 red;\n    class Quasi,Ex2 amber;\n    class Sensitive,Ex3 purple;\n    class NonSens,Ex4 green;</pre>\n</div><div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#f6fcf4] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#15803d] text-xs my-2 leading-relaxed font-sans text-[#151b20]\">\n  <strong class=\"block mb-0.5 font-black uppercase tracking-wider font-mono text-[10px] text-[#15803d]\">💡 Industrial Best Practice</strong>\n  <span class=\"font-medium\">Integrate high-speed regex tokenizers and transformer-based Named Entity Recognition (e.g., Presidio or spaCy) directly into the stream ingestion consumer. PII is scrubbed in-flight before payload records touch disk or log storage.</span>\n</div><div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#fffdf7] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#151b20] flex items-start gap-2.5 my-2\">\n  <span class=\"text-[#0e7490] font-black text-sm mt-0.5\">◆</span>\n  <div>\n    <strong class=\"text-[#0e7490] text-xs md:text-sm font-black block\">Direct Identifiers ($\\mathcal{D}_{\\text{id}}$)</strong>\n    <span class=\"text-[#334155] text-xs block mt-0.5 leading-relaxed font-medium\">Attributes that uniquely identify an individual in isolation with zero auxiliary data (e.g., Social Security Number, National Identity ID, biometrics, personal email address).</span>\n  </div>\n</div><div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#fffdf7] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#151b20] flex items-start gap-2.5 my-2\">\n  <span class=\"text-[#0e7490] font-black text-sm mt-0.5\">▸</span>\n  <div>\n    <strong class=\"text-[#0e7490] text-xs md:text-sm font-black block\">Quasi-Identifiers ($\\mathcal{Q}_{\\text{id}}$)</strong>\n    <span class=\"text-[#334155] text-xs block mt-0.5 leading-relaxed font-medium\">Attributes that do not single out a person individually, but when combined with external public datasets (voter registries, land titles, social media), uniquely re-identify the data subject.</span>\n  </div>\n</div><div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#fffdf7] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#151b20] flex items-start gap-2.5 my-2\">\n  <span class=\"text-[#0e7490] font-black text-sm mt-0.5\">⚡</span>\n  <div>\n    <strong class=\"text-[#0e7490] text-xs md:text-sm font-black block\">Sensitive Attributes ($\\mathcal{S}_{\\text{attr}}$)</strong>\n    <span class=\"text-[#334155] text-xs block mt-0.5 leading-relaxed font-medium\">High-stakes confidential attributes that subjects wish to keep private (e.g., oncology diagnosis, annual compensation, religion).</span>\n  </div>\n</div><div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#fffdf7] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#151b20] flex items-start gap-2.5 my-2\">\n  <span class=\"text-[#0e7490] font-black text-sm mt-0.5\">💡</span>\n  <div>\n    <strong class=\"text-[#0e7490] text-xs md:text-sm font-black block\">Insensitive Non-Identifiers ($\\mathcal{Z}$)</strong>\n    <span class=\"text-[#334155] text-xs block mt-0.5 leading-relaxed font-medium\">Public or benign operational telemetry.</span>\n  </div>\n</div>"
