          "contentHtml": "<div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#fffdf7] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#151b20] flex items-start gap-2.5 my-2\">\n  <span class=\"text-[#0e7490] font-black text-sm mt-0.5\">◆</span>\n  <div>\n    <strong class=\"text-[#0e7490] text-xs md:text-sm font-black block\">Extraterritorial Jurisdiction</strong>\n    <span class=\"text-[#334155] text-xs block mt-0.5 leading-relaxed font-medium\">The GDPR binds any pipeline handling EU residents regardless of server geography; statutory fines scale up to $4\\%$ of worldwide turnover.</span>\n  </div>\n</div><div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#fffdf7] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#151b20] flex items-start gap-2.5 my-2\">\n  <span class=\"text-[#0e7490] font-black text-sm mt-0.5\">▸</span>\n  <div>\n    <strong class=\"text-[#0e7490] text-xs md:text-sm font-black block\">The 72-Hour Breach Clock</strong>\n    <span class=\"text-[#334155] text-xs block mt-0.5 leading-relaxed font-medium\">Incident response runbooks must ensure breach forensics identify affected scopes within 72 hours of detection.</span>\n  </div>\n</div><div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#fffdf7] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#151b20] flex items-start gap-2.5 my-2\">\n  <span class=\"text-[#0e7490] font-black text-sm mt-0.5\">⚡</span>\n  <div>\n    <strong class=\"text-[#0e7490] text-xs md:text-sm font-black block\">Safe Harbor vs. Expert Determination</strong>\n    <span class=\"text-[#334155] text-xs block mt-0.5 leading-relaxed font-medium\">HIPAA Safe Harbor requires scrubbing all 18 identifiers; partial retention requires formal statistical certification ($P(\\text{Re-ID}) \\le 0.05$).</span>\n  </div>\n</div><div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#fffdf7] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#151b20] flex items-start gap-2.5 my-2\">\n  <span class=\"text-[#0e7490] font-black text-sm mt-0.5\">💡</span>\n  <div>\n    <strong class=\"text-[#0e7490] text-xs md:text-sm font-black block\">Statutory CCPA Damages</strong>\n    <span class=\"text-[#334155] text-xs block mt-0.5 leading-relaxed font-medium\">California statutory damages ($N \\times \\$750$) expose enterprises to immense liabilities without plaintiffs proving actual fraud.</span>\n  </div>\n</div>"
