          "contentHtml": "<div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-[#fffdf7] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[4px_4px_0px_#151b20] my-2 overflow-x-auto text-center\">\n  <div class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-[#0e7490] font-black uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 text-left flex items-center justify-between border-b-2 border-[#151b20]/15 pb-1\">\n    <span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n      <span>📊 Architecture &amp; Workflow Diagram</span>\n      <span class=\"text-[#151b20]/40\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"text-[#334155]\">System Flowchart</span>\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"text-[#0e7490] text-[9px] font-mono bg-[#c9f3f4] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-[#151b20]\">Mermaid SVG</span>\n  </div>\n  <pre class=\"mermaid py-1 flex justify-center text-xs overflow-x-auto leading-normal\">flowchart LR\n    Threat[\"Threat Actor / Adversary\"] --> V1[\"Vector 1: Unpatched Internet Dependencies<br/>(e.g., Apache Struts CVE-2017-5638)\"]\n    Threat --> V2[\"Vector 2: Third-Party Supply Chain<br/>(HVAC / SaaS credentials)\"]\n    Threat --> V3[\"Vector 3: Cloud Misconfigurations<br/>(Public S3 Buckets / Open Elasticsearch)\"]\n    Threat --> V4[\"Vector 4: Credential Stuffing & Linkage Attacks<br/>(Re-identification [[Sweeney2002](#ref-sweeney2002)])\"]\n\n    V1 & V2 & V3 & V4 --> Infiltrate[\"Network Infiltration & Privilege Escalation\"]\n    Infiltrate --> Dwell[\"Undetected Dwell Period (Median: 200+ Days)\"]\n    Dwell --> Exfil[\"Exfiltration of High-Value Identity Stores\"]\n\n    classDef blue fill:#c9f3f4,stroke:#151b20,stroke-width:2px,color:#151b20;\n    classDef amber fill:#fff0b9,stroke:#151b20,stroke-width:2px,color:#151b20;\n    classDef red fill:#ffd8ce,stroke:#151b20,stroke-width:2px,color:#151b20;\n\n    class Threat,V1,V2,V3,V4 blue;\n    class Infiltrate amber;\n    class Dwell,Exfil red;</pre>\n</div><div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#f6fcf4] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#15803d] text-xs my-2 leading-relaxed font-sans text-[#151b20]\">\n  <strong class=\"block mb-0.5 font-black uppercase tracking-wider font-mono text-[10px] text-[#15803d]\">💡 Industrial Best Practice</strong>\n  <span class=\"font-medium\">Store sensitive dataset columns using Envelope Encryption: data fields are encrypted with an ephemeral Data Encryption Key (DEK), and the DEK is encrypted under a Key Encryption Key (KEK) managed inside a FIPS 140-2 Level 3 Hardware Security Module (</span>\n</div><div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#fffdf7] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#151b20] flex items-start gap-2.5 my-2\">\n  <span class=\"text-[#0e7490] font-black text-sm mt-0.5\">◆</span>\n  <div>\n    <strong class=\"text-[#0e7490] text-xs md:text-sm font-black block\">| Infiltration Vector</strong>\n    <span class=\"text-[#334155] text-xs block mt-0.5 leading-relaxed font-medium\">| Underlying Root Cause | Typical Asset Targeted | Preventative Engineering Countermeasure | | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | | Unpatched Dependencies | Failure to track Software Bill of Materials (SBOM) and apply zero-day security patches.</span>\n  </div>\n</div><div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#fffdf7] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#151b20] flex items-start gap-2.5 my-2\">\n  <span class=\"text-[#0e7490] font-black text-sm mt-0.5\">▸</span>\n  <div>\n    <strong class=\"text-[#0e7490] text-xs md:text-sm font-black block\">| Web application</strong>\n    <span class=\"text-[#334155] text-xs block mt-0.5 leading-relaxed font-medium\">portals, REST ingress endpoints.</span>\n  </div>\n</div><div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#fffdf7] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#151b20] flex items-start gap-2.5 my-2\">\n  <span class=\"text-[#0e7490] font-black text-sm mt-0.5\">⚡</span>\n  <div>\n    <strong class=\"text-[#0e7490] text-xs md:text-sm font-black block\">| Automated dependency</strong>\n    <span class=\"text-[#334155] text-xs block mt-0.5 leading-relaxed font-medium\">vulnerability scanners (Dependabot, Snyk), immutable container rebuilds.</span>\n  </div>\n</div><div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#fffdf7] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#151b20] flex items-start gap-2.5 my-2\">\n  <span class=\"text-[#0e7490] font-black text-sm mt-0.5\">💡</span>\n  <div>\n    <strong class=\"text-[#0e7490] text-xs md:text-sm font-black block\">| | Supply</strong>\n    <span class=\"text-[#334155] text-xs block mt-0.5 leading-relaxed font-medium\">Chain / Third-Party | External contractor granted unsegmented, excessive network access privileges.</span>\n  </div>\n</div>"
