        "type": "bullets",
        "solo": {
          "speaker": "Dr. Nova (Senior Architect)",
          "title": "Key Engineering Takeaways",
          "turns": [
            {
              "speaker": "Dr. Nova",
              "text": "Key Engineering Takeaways. Data-Centric AI requires treating dataset curation with the exact same rigor, versioning, and defensive auditing as neural model code. Fixing defects at the boundary guarantees downstream reliability."
            }
          ],
          "contentHtml": "<div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#fffdf7] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#151b20] flex items-start gap-2.5 my-2\">\n  <span class=\"text-[#0e7490] font-black text-sm mt-0.5\">◆</span>\n  <div>\n    <strong class=\"text-[#0e7490] text-xs md:text-sm font-black block\">Assumed Breach Principle</strong>\n    <span class=\"text-[#334155] text-xs block mt-0.5 leading-relaxed font-medium\">Never rely on a single firewall or gateway; architect every sub-service assuming adjacent nodes are already compromised.</span>\n  </div>\n</div><div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#fffdf7] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#151b20] flex items-start gap-2.5 my-2\">\n  <span class=\"text-[#0e7490] font-black text-sm mt-0.5\">▸</span>\n  <div>\n    <strong class=\"text-[#0e7490] text-xs md:text-sm font-black block\">Blast Radius Minimization</strong>\n    <span class=\"text-[#334155] text-xs block mt-0.5 leading-relaxed font-medium\">Strict network subnets and least-privilege IAM prevent lateral movement from internet ingress to database analytical storage.</span>\n  </div>\n</div><div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#fffdf7] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#151b20] flex items-start gap-2.5 my-2\">\n  <span class=\"text-[#0e7490] font-black text-sm mt-0.5\">⚡</span>\n  <div>\n    <strong class=\"text-[#0e7490] text-xs md:text-sm font-black block\">NIST 800-61 Runbooks</strong>\n    <span class=\"text-[#334155] text-xs block mt-0.5 leading-relaxed font-medium\">Maintain automated isolation scripts to revoke tokens and snapshot affected instances within minutes of alert triage.</span>\n  </div>\n</div><div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#fffdf7] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#151b20] flex items-start gap-2.5 my-2\">\n  <span class=\"text-[#0e7490] font-black text-sm mt-0.5\">💡</span>\n  <div>\n    <strong class=\"text-[#0e7490] text-xs md:text-sm font-black block\">Immutable Backup Safeguards</strong>\n    <span class=\"text-[#334155] text-xs block mt-0.5 leading-relaxed font-medium\">Protect backup snapshots with cryptographic write-once-read-many (WORM) storage locks to guarantee recovery from ransomware.</span>\n  </div>\n</div>"
        },
