          "contentHtml": "<div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-[#fffdf7] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#151b20] my-2 text-center\">\n  <div class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-[#0e7490] font-black uppercase tracking-wider mb-1 text-left flex items-center justify-between\">\n    <span>📐 Mathematical Formulation</span>\n    <span class=\"text-[#151b20] text-[9px] font-mono bg-[#eee4c8] px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-[#151b20]\">Empirical Sample Formulation</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"text-base md:text-lg font-serif text-[#151b20] py-1 overflow-x-auto bg-[#f0fbfd] border border-[#0e7490] rounded-lg my-1\">\n    $$\\boldsymbol{\\delta}^* = \\arg\\min_{\\boldsymbol{\\delta}} \\text{Cost}(\\mathbf{x}, \\mathbf{x} + \\boldsymbol{\\delta}) \\quad \\text{s.t.} \\quad f(\\mathbf{x} + \\boldsymbol{\\delta}) = 1$$\n  </div>\n</div><div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-[#fffdf7] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#151b20] my-2 text-center\">\n  <div class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-[#0e7490] font-black uppercase tracking-wider mb-1 text-left flex items-center justify-between\">\n    <span>📐 Mathematical Formulation</span>\n    <span class=\"text-[#151b20] text-[9px] font-mono bg-[#eee4c8] px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-[#151b20]\">Distribution Measure</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"text-base md:text-lg font-serif text-[#151b20] py-1 overflow-x-auto bg-[#f0fbfd] border border-[#0e7490] rounded-lg my-1\">\n    $$\\text{Cost}(\\mathbf{x}, \\mathbf{x} + \\boldsymbol{\\delta}) = \\sum_{j=1}^d \\frac{|\\delta_j|}{\\sigma_j} \\cdot \\mathbb{I}(\\text{Mutable}_j = 1)$$\n  </div>\n</div>"
