          "contentHtml": "<div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-[#fffdf7] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#151b20] my-2 text-center\">\n  <div class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-[#0e7490] font-black uppercase tracking-wider mb-1 text-left flex items-center justify-between\">\n    <span>📐 Mathematical Formulation</span>\n    <span class=\"text-[#151b20] text-[9px] font-mono bg-[#eee4c8] px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-[#151b20]\">Empirical Sample Formulation</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"text-base md:text-lg font-serif text-[#151b20] py-1 overflow-x-auto bg-[#f0fbfd] border border-[#0e7490] rounded-lg my-1\">\n    $$\\forall r_i \\in \\mathcal{D}_k, \\quad \\text{GeoLocation}\\left(\\text{Storage}(r_i)\\right) \\subseteq \\text{Territory}(\\mathcal{J}_k)$$\n  </div>\n</div><div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#fffdf7] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#151b20] flex items-start gap-2.5 my-2\">\n  <span class=\"text-[#0e7490] font-black text-sm mt-0.5\">◆</span>\n  <div>\n    <strong class=\"text-[#0e7490] text-xs md:text-sm font-black block\">National frameworks (EU</strong>\n    <span class=\"text-[#334155] text-xs block mt-0.5 leading-relaxed font-medium\">GDPR Schrems II (Voigt, 2017), China PIPL, India DPDP) mandate that personal data cannot exit physical geopolitical territories without rigorous legal equivalency:</span>\n  </div>\n</div>"
